# XTheadFMemIdx
:th.flrw frd,rs1,rs2,thUimm2 is op0006=0x0b & funct3=6 & op2731=0x8 & frd & rs1 & rs2 & thUimm2
{
	local ea:$(XLEN) = rs1 + (rs2 << thUimm2);
	local v:4 = *[ram]:4 ea;
	frd = 0xffffffff00000000 | zext(v);
}

:th.fsrw fr0711,rs1,rs2,thUimm2 is op0006=0x0b & funct3=7 & op2731=0x8 & fr0711 & rs1 & rs2 & thUimm2
{
